    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NewPark Lodge is an attractive bungalow residence occupying a magnificent private position in a most sought-after residential area most convenient to all Kildare Town amenities & a short drive to the M7 motorway.\r\n\r\nWhilst requiring modernising & upgrading New Park Lodge provides a wonderful opportunity to a discerning purchaser to create a modern home tailored to their own style and requirements\r\n\r\nSet on a mature site with an array of shrubs and trees with extensive lawn area, the garden provides a wonderful outdoor area for family entertainment. Detached garage to side of residence provides further possibilities. \r\n\r\nAccommodation: Entrance hall, open plan Livingroom/family room, dining room, kitchen, family bathroom and three bedrooms.\r\n\r\nOutside:  \r\nElevated site with ample driveway & lawn to front. Rear enclosed garden & lawn area with mature hedging providing great privacy."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\t\t3.7 x 2.2\tWood Flooring\t\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nDining Room:\t\t3.3 x 3.5\tWood Flooring\r\n\r\nSitting Room:\t\t3.8 x 3.6\tWood fireplace\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFitted Units\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tCarpeted Flooring\r\n\t\t\t\t\r\nFamily Room:\t\t3.5 x 3\t\r\n\r\nInner Hall:\t\t\t3.6 x 1\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nKitchen: \t\t\t4.2 x 1.7\tTiled Flooring & Walls\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDoor to rear\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nBathroom:\t\t\t2.6 x 2.7\tTiled Flooring\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tElectric shower\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t\t\t4 x 3  Carpeted flooring\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t  Fitted Units\r\n \r\nBedroom 2:\t\t\t4 x 3.5 Wood Flooring\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    Fitted units\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\t\t\t2.8 x 2.7\tCarpeted flooring\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t        Fitted Units"
